title: Export Filename + Export All Batch Export
summary: Added smart export filenames and batch Export All to Atelier Studio. Single-file exports now use the loaded file's name instead of hardcoded "animation". A new Export All button in the sidebar footer lets users batch-render every .atelier file to GIF, MP4, or WebM, saved alongside the source files. Also fixed H.264 codec profile selection for 1080p@60fps MP4 export and the CLI --version display.
